PART 3: EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud)

EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud) is one of the most frequently asked AWS services in DevOps interviews. Almost every AWS interview includes EC2 because it is the foundation for running applications in the cloud.

What is EC2?

Amazon EC2 is a service that provides resizable virtual servers (instances) in the cloud.

Instead of buying a physical server, AWS allows you to create virtual machines on demand.

